# Title: Metasploit Or Impacket Service Installation Via SMB PsExec
# ID: 6fb63b40-e02a-403e-9ffd-3bcc1d749442
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Bartlomiej Czyz, Relativity
# Date: 2021-01-21
# Tags: attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1021.002, attack.t1570, attack.execution, attack.t1569.002
# Description: Detects usage of Metasploit SMB PsExec (exploit/windows/smb/psexec) and Impacket psexec.py by triggering on specific service installation
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((winlog.event_id:"4697" AND ServiceFileName:/^%systemroot%\\[a-zA-Z]{8}\.exe$/ AND ServiceName:/(^[a-zA-Z]{4}$)|(^[a-zA-Z]{8}$)|(^[a-zA-Z]{16}$)/ AND ServiceStartType:"3" AND ServiceType:"0x10") AND NOT ((ServiceName:"PSEXESVC")))
